  "entry": "code/README.md",
  "notes": "Found in a public repository and run by a computer-use agent (batch public-1). Measures the percent of a masked brain region covered by axonal fluorescence signal, using Otsu thresholding on uploaded .tif images, and returns summary tables, bar plots, profiles along the medio-lateral and dorso-ventral axes, and per-image control plots that can be downloaded as PDF. Data used in the run: example. tree.json is the workflow the agent did and a second agent replayed; run.json says how.",
